<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;">
<div style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#393939;"><div> </div>
<p data-end="349" data-start="330">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},<!--StartFragment--></p>
<p>We are pleased to announce the introduction of our FRE® Lush and Sweet 3mg and 6mg Nicotine Pouches. This exciting new addition to the FRE® Nicotine Pouch family.</p>
<p>FRE® Nicotine Pouches offer a complete assortment designed to meet a wide range of consumer preferences. Available in strengths ranging from 3MG to 15MG. FRE® delivers variety across five distinct styles: Mint, Wintergreen, Lush, Sweet, and Original. Please refer to the link below for the full lineup of FRE® SKUs available for order.</p>
<p><a href="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0494/8089/2572/files/FRE_Sales_Flyer_1.pdf?v=1755810961" style="color:#FF3C3C; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none">FRE SALES SHEET</a></p>
<p>As one of the fastest-growing nicotine pouch brands on the market, FRE® continues to lead the category with:</p>
