<div>
<ul>
<li>FRE’s unique pre-primed moisture technology delivers rapid nicotine and flavor release, offering a convenient, discreet, and modern alternative to the dry, stale pouches currently on the market.</li>
<li>Expanded strength options ranging from 3MG–15MG</li>
<li>20 pouches per can — that’s 33% more than the 15-pouch standard offered by leading competitors</li>
<li>Exceptional customer loyalty and repeat purchase rates</li>
<li>Proprietary technology that delivers measurable performance advantages competitors simply cannot match</li>
</ul>
FRE® is more than just another nicotine pouch — it is a growing family of solutions designed to elevate the nicotine pouch experience.</div>
<div> </div>
<div>If you have any questions, please reach out.</div>
<div> </div>
<div>Best Regards,</div>
<div> </div>
